.\n\nOur curated VR VLOGs feature high-quality 8K VR180 videos, up to 90FPS. Comfort is our top priority, and we strictly eliminate dizziness.\n\nNotice: \n- Best experience is achieved when using in China Mainland.\n- The app contains streamed experiences and good internet connectivity is required.\n- The streamed content is provided by the developer and may not be available in perpetuity.", "short_description": "Immersive VLOG: Travel globally through 360\u00b0 VR experiences\u2014feel like you\u2019re actually there, no travel needed!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1264028318869220", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "JustVR (\u7b80\u9002VR)", "keywords": ["VR180", "immersive", "VLOG"], "long_description": "VR180\u683c\u5f0fVLOG\uff0c\u6700\u9ad88K90\u5e27\u9ad8\u89c4\u683c\u62cd\u6444\n\u8212\u9002\u6027\u4e25\u683c\u628a\u5173\uff0c\u62d2\u7edd\u7729\u6655\n\u8db3\u4e0d\u51fa\u6237\uff0c\u73af\u6e38\u4e16\u754c\n\n\u63d0\u793a\uff1a\n- \u672c\u5e94\u7528\u5728\u4e2d\u56fd\u5927\u9646\u4f7f\u7528\u624d\u80fd\u63d0\u4f9b\u6700\u597d\u7684\u4f53\u9a8c\u3002\n- \u672c\u5e94\u7528\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\u662f\u5728\u7ebf\u64ad\u653e\u7684\uff0c\u56e0\u6b64\u9700\u8981\u826f\u597d\u7684\u4e92\u8054\u7f51\u8fde\u63a5\u3002\n- \u672c\u5e94\u7528\u7684\u5185\u5bb9\u7531\u5f00\u53d1\u8005\u63d0\u4f9b\uff0c\u4e14\u53ef\u80fd\u5e76\u975e\u6c38\u4e45\u53ef\u7528\u3002", "short_description": "\u6c89\u6d78\u5f0fVLOG, \u4e58\u7740VR\u53bb\u65c5\u884c"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.justvr.cn/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "JustVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.justvr.cn/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "43496192621597